cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use StunAssure in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "StunAssure: a fail-safe verification stack for humane fish stunning and slaughter"
abstract: >-
  StunAssure verifies, cheaply and fail-safe, that each batch of fish was rendered
  insensible and stayed insensible until death (simulate → verify → certify → report).
  It measures the stun physically, verifies insensibility, enforces the recovery window,
  and certifies the batch statistically, emitting a SHA-256-signed, tamper-evident audit
  record. The verification core has zero runtime dependencies.
type: software
